\section{PDG arrays}

For defining aliases, we introduce a special type which holds a set of
(integer) PDG codes. 
<<[[pdg_arrays.f90]]>>=
<<File header>>

module pdg_arrays

<<Use file utils>>

<<Standard module head>>

<<PDG arrays: public>>

